the-firm-as-one-program-13 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-13 = unlines (cons "- **P2** Programs, relations and their justifications in one language, with the reasoning kept as data (hyperactivity v31 §1–2)." (cons "  A routine, the property required of it and the reasoning that establishes the property are constructions of the same language. A requirement is a chosen family of types and its proof is an inhabitant, so the reasoning an engineer already performs to build something correctly is kept for later use instead of being thrown away or rewritten in a separate verification tool (hyperactivity v31 §1, §2)." nil))
